Quest Mandatory Training At Kobold Mine
    Events
        Time - Every 5.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (KoboldCamp <gen> contains Nazgrek) Equal to True
                (KoboldCamp <gen> contains Zulkis) Equal to True
        (KoboldCamp <gen> contains BoomBrothers) Equal to True
    Actions
        -------- Check if Boom Brothers are with Player --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Distance between (Position of BoomBrothers) and (Position of Nazgrek)) Less than or equal to 1000.00
